    "text": "Describe the hereditarily just infinite pro-p-groups of finite width.\n   Definitions: A pro-p-group G has finite width pd if |γi (G)/γi+1 (G)| ⩽ pd for all i,\nand G is hereditarily just infinite if G is infinite and each of its open subgroups has\nno closed normal subgroups of infinite index.                      C. R. Leedham-Green",
